card.statement:
The following hold.

- [(i)] The action of $\Gamma$ on $V(T(v))$ is given by the following formulas.

\begin{equation}
c_{ij}\mathcal{D}_{I}T(v+z)=\sum_{J\subseteq I}\mathcal{D}^{v}_{J}\left(\gamma_{ij}(v+z)\right)\mathcal{D}_{I\setminus J}T(v+z)
\end{equation}

- [(ii)] We have $(c_{ij}-\gamma_{ij}(v+z))^{|I|+1}\mathcal{D}_{I}T(v+z)=0$. In particular, $V(T(v))$ is a Gelfand-Tsetlin module.
